TEXT 80 540 Left 2 ;=================== PUNTO 4.2.3: ESPEJO MOS MULTI-SALIDA (1x, 2x, 3x) ===================
TEXT 80 575 Left 2 ;Q1 (Referencia): W1 = 10u, L1 = 1u -> (W/L)1 = 10 | I_REF = 50 uA | Rs1 = Rs = 1k
TEXT 80 610 Left 2 ;Q2 (Salida 2):   W2 = 20u, L2 = 1u -> (W/L)2 = 2 * (W/L)1 = 20 | I_OUT2 = 100 uA (2x) | Rs2 = Rs/2 = 500
TEXT 80 645 Left 2 ;Q3 (Salida 3):   W3 = 30u, L3 = 1u -> (W/L)3 = 3 * (W/L)1 = 30 | I_OUT3 = 150 uA (3x) | Rs3 = Rs/3 = 333.3
TEXT 80 685 Left 2 !.model NMOS_MOD NMOS(Level=1 Vto=0.7 Kp=200u Lambda=0.02)
TEXT 80 720 Left 2 !.param RS = 1k
TEXT 80 760 Left 2 ;--- BARRIDO DC: Barrido de tension en drenador V_O2 de 0 a 3.3V ---
TEXT 80 795 Left 2 !.dc V_O2 0 3.3 0.02
TEXT 80 835 Left 2 ;--- MEDICIONES DE COMPROBACION (.MEAS) A V_O2 = 1.5V ---
TEXT 80 870 Left 2 !.meas dc I_REF_VAL FIND I(I_REF) AT 1.5
TEXT 80 905 Left 2 !.meas dc ID2_VAL   FIND -I(V_O2) AT 1.5
TEXT 80 940 Left 2 !.meas dc ID3_VAL   FIND -I(V_O3) AT 1.5
TEXT 80 975 Left 2 !.meas dc RATIO_2   PARAM ID2_VAL / I_REF_VAL
TEXT 80 1010 Left 2 !.meas dc RATIO_3   PARAM ID3_VAL / I_REF_VAL
